instructions:
You receive items extracted by small worker models, each with the message subject and an evidence quote. Do NOT re-extract. Only flag an item when one of these is true:
- the due time does not match the evidence (wrong day, wrong time, wrong timezone conversion);
- confidence is low;
- the status looks wrong (e.g. evidence says 'moved' or 'extended' but status is 'new'; evidence says 'cancelled' but status is not);
- the same task appears twice with different dates and neither is marked 'update'.
Return the ids to flag with a one-sentence reason. Everything else is accepted. Flag sparingly.
